Subject: [PATCH 37/41] completed output command processing.

---
 spiffer/spiffer.c               | 16 +++++++++++++---
 test_code/include/spif.h        |  9 ++++++---
 test_code/include/spif_remote.h | 30 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
